    <string name="guide_button">How to Use FD Player</string>
    <string name="guide_dialog_title">Welcome to FD Player!</string>
    <string name="guide_dialog_body">FD Player is a lightweight glassmorphic player tailored to your style:

• On the Player screen, background blobs adapt to your album art colors, and the steering wheel button switches to Driving Mode.
• In Downloads, paste any webpage link to extract and save audio tracks into Downloads/FD Player.
• In Playlists, create Bluetooth autoplay rules so your favorite music starts automatically in the car!</string>
    <string name="got_it">Got it</string>

    <!-- First-time Section Tips -->
    <string name="tip_player">This is your Player! Toggle Driving Mode or Mic Rhythm from the top corners, and expand the bar below the controls for shuffle and repeat.</string>
    <string name="tip_library">All your device tracks live here. Tap any song to play or use the menu to add it to a playlist.</string>
    <string name="tip_downloads">Paste any webpage URL here to find downloadable audio links and save them into Downloads/FD Player.</string>
    <string name="tip_playlists">Build your custom playlists and set up Bluetooth autoplay rules for hands-free listening.</string>
    <string name="tip_settings">Switch between Dark, Light, System, or 8 Custom color palettes and change the app language anytime.</string>

